This software includes:
- Golf analytics engine for Garmin R10 launch monitor data
- Physics-adjusted yardage modeling (wind correction, carry percentiles)
- Shot shape classification and dispersion mapping
- Streamlit dashboard with Altair visualizations
- FastAPI backend with Supabase (PostgreSQL) persistence
